/ A tour of what the language server can tell you about a program.
/ Open this file with mrs-lsp attached and try:
/   - hover over a mnemonic, a label, or a hex operand
/   - go to definition on `First`, then find references
/   - rename `Total`
/   - inlay hints show each line's address and assembled word
/   - the two mistakes below have quick fixes

        Load  First
        Add   Second
        Store Total
        Skipcond C00        / quick fix: should be 0C00
        Jump  Report
        HALT                / lint: not the canonical spelling
Report, Output
        Halt
First,  DEC 21
Second, DEC 21
Total,  DEC 0
Unused, DEC 0               / lint: never referenced
